#: src/help.c:46
msgid ""
"Each xpad session consists of one or more open pads.  These pads are basically sticky notes on your desktop in which you can write memos.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tá seisiún xpad comhdhéanta de ceap amháin oscailte ar a laghad.  Tá siad mar nótaí greamaitheacha ar do dheasc inar féidir leat meamraim a scríobh.\n"
"\n"

#: src/help.c:50
msgid ""
"<b>To move a pad</b>, left drag on the toolbar, right drag on the resizer in the bottom right, or hold down CTRL while left dragging anywhere on the pad.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chun ceap a bhogadh</b>, tarraing ar clé ar an mbarra uirlisí, tarraing ar dheis ar an bhunathraitheoir méide (íochtar ar dheis),nó coinnigh CTRL síos agus ag tarraingt ar clé in áit ar bith ar an gceap.\n"
"\n"

#: src/help.c:54
msgid ""
"<b>To resize a pad</b>, left drag on the resizer or hold down CTRL while right dragging anywhere on the pad.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chun an mhéid a athrú</b>, tarraing ar clé ar an bhunathraitheoir méide, nó coinnigh CTRL síos agus ag tarraingt ar dheis in áit ar bith ar an gceap.\n"
"\n"

#: src/help.c:57
msgid ""
"<b>To change color settings</b>, right click on a pad and choose Edit->Preferences.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chun na hairíonna dathúcháin a athrú</b>, cliceáil ar dheis ar ceap agus roghnaigh Eagar+Airíonna.\n"
"\n"

#: src/help.c:60
msgid ""
"Most actions are available throught the popup menu that appears when you right click on a pad.  Try it out and enjoy.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tá an chuid is mó de na gníomhartha ar fáil tríd an roghchlár aníos a fheiceann tú nuair a chliceáil ar dheis ar ceap.  Bain triail as agus bain sult as.\n"
"\n"

#: src/help.c:64
msgid "Please send comments or bug reports to xpad-devel@lists.sourceforge.net"
msgstr "Seol tuairiscí fabhtanna nó léirmheasanna chuig xpad-devel@lists.sourceforge.net"

